sent

one slide
per paragraph

@/usr/share/sent/nyan.png

depends on
SDL
freetype
libpng

usage:
$ sent FILE

▸ arrows / space / click: next slide
▸ backspace / p: previous slide
▸ r: reload, q: quit

# comments are ignored

decks are plain text
(write one in vi,
present it here)

\@not_an_image.png
⇒ backslash escapes specials

@/usr/share/sent/trans.ff
